  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-en-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — English (seller autopilot v2)', 'English', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', null, 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-es-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Spanish (seller autopilot v2)', 'Spanish', 'Lo entiendo. ¿Estaría abierto a algo como financiamiento del dueño o un arrendamiento con opción a compra? A veces eso ayuda con los impuestos sobre la ganancia.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-pt-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Portuguese (seller autopilot v2)', 'Portuguese', 'Entendo. Você estaria aberto a algo como financiamento pelo proprietário ou aluguel com opção de compra? Às vezes isso ajuda com o imposto sobre ganho de capital.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-fr-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — French (seller autopilot v2)', 'French', 'Je comprends. Seriez-vous ouvert à un financement par le vendeur ou une location avec option d''achat ? Cela peut parfois aider pour l''impôt sur la plus-value.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-de-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — German (seller autopilot v2)', 'German', 'Verstehe. Wären Sie offen für eine Verkäuferfinanzierung oder Miete mit Kaufoption? Das kann manchmal bei der Steuer auf den Gewinn helfen.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-it-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Italian (seller autopilot v2)', 'Italian', 'Capisco. Sarebbe aperto a un finanziamento da parte del venditore o a un affitto con riscatto? A volte aiuta con le tasse sulla plusvalenza.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-pl-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Polish (seller autopilot v2)', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem. Czy byłbyś otwarty na finansowanie przez sprzedającego albo najem z opcją kupna? Czasem to pomaga z podatkiem od zysku.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-vi-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Vietnamese (seller autopilot v2)', 'Vietnamese', 'Tôi hiểu. Bạn có cân nhắc hình thức người bán cho trả góp hoặc thuê có quyền mua không? Đôi khi cách đó giúp giảm thuế lãi vốn.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', false),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-zh-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Mandarin (seller autopilot v2)', 'Mandarin', '理解。您愿意考虑卖方融资或带购买选择权的租赁吗？有时这样对资本利得税有帮助。', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', true),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-ko-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Korean (seller autopilot v2)', 'Korean', '이해합니다. 매도인 금융이나 매입 옵션부 임대 같은 방식도 고려해 보시겠어요? 경우에 따라 양도소득세에 도움이 될 수 있습니다.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', true),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-ja-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Japanese (seller autopilot v2)', 'Japanese', 'よく分かります。売主ファイナンスやリースオプションのような形はご検討いただけますか？場合によっては譲渡益の税金に役立ちます。', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', true),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-he-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Hebrew (seller autopilot v2)', 'Hebrew', 'מבין. היית פתוח למשהו כמו מימון מצד המוכר או שכירות עם אופציה לרכישה? לפעמים זה עוזר עם מס שבח.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', true),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-ar-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Arabic (seller autopilot v2)', 'Arabic', 'أتفهم ذلك. هل أنت منفتح على شيء مثل تمويل البائع أو الإيجار مع خيار الشراء؟ أحياناً يساعد ذلك في ضريبة الأرباح الرأسمالية.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', true),
  ('capital_gains_creative_probe', 'lc-ap2-cgcp-ru-1', 'capital_gains_creative_probe — Russian (seller autopilot v2)', 'Russian', 'Понимаю. Вы бы рассмотрели рассрочку от продавца или аренду с правом выкупа? Иногда это помогает с налогом на прирост капитала.', 'Totally understand. Would you be open to something like seller financing or a lease option? That can sometimes help with capital gains.', 'S4C', 'Stage 4C Capital Gains Creative Probe', 'new_use_case', true),
